{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659774",
      "title": "Component Instances Work In Isolation!",
      "sourceHash": "2fe1f884cd1135558c3544a10f1330d2e3f3ebcfc79f81b58caa93d54665789c",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.54,
          "end": 3.15,
          "en": "Now, before we're going to continue working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.15,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "on this player component and this editing functionality,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 10.173,
          "en": "there's one important thing I wanna point out here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.07,
          "end": 13.77,
          "en": "As you can see in this application here, if I reload",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.77,
          "end": 17.67,
          "en": "if I click Edit here, we show the input field here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 21.63,
          "en": "but the other player component here does not change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.63,
          "end": 25.143,
          "en": "Here we're still showing the player name instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 26.22,
          "end": 29.28,
          "en": "And that's a pretty important thing to note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 29.28,
          "end": 31.65,
          "en": "because in the end of course we are using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.65,
          "end": 34.563,
          "en": "the same component here, the player component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 35.46,
          "end": 40.46,
          "en": "But whenever you are using or reusing a component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 41.13,
          "end": 45.84,
          "en": "React will basically create a new isolated instance.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 45.84,
          "end": 49.68,
          "en": "So even though both these players here use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.68,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "the same player component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 55.17,
          "en": "they work totally isolated from each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 55.17,
          "end": 56.04,
          "en": "If the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.04,
          "end": 60.27,
          "en": "in this first player component instance here changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.27,
          "end": 64.32,
          "en": "the second player component instance does not care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.32,
          "end": 65.7,
          "en": "about that at all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 68.163,
          "en": "It doesn't even know about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.66,
          "end": 71.19,
          "en": "So we have a shared component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.19,
          "end": 73.44,
          "en": "with the same logic inside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.44,
          "end": 76.23,
          "en": "but then once you use that component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.23,
          "end": 80.4,
          "en": "totally different isolated instances are created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.4,
          "end": 82.62,
          "en": "which only use the same logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.62,
          "end": 85.44,
          "en": "but they then use it on their own.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.44,
          "end": 88.59,
          "en": "And that's a really important feature in React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.59,
          "end": 92.00999999999999,
          "en": "and a feature which I absolutely wanna emphasize here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.00999999999999,
          "end": 95.58,
          "en": "because this is one of the most powerful React features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.58,
          "end": 98.22,
          "en": "Having this isolation allows you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.22,
          "end": 102.03,
          "en": "to build super complex reusable components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.03,
          "end": 104.97,
          "en": "which don't interfere with each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.97,
          "end": 107.43,
          "en": "Because of course here it would not be great",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.43,
          "end": 109.95,
          "en": "if we would click Edit here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.95,
          "end": 113.07,
          "en": "and the second player would get edited for some reason.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 113.07,
          "end": 114.3,
          "en": "That would be horrible,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.3,
          "end": 117.39,
          "en": "and this whole component concept would be useless",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.39,
          "end": 119.25,
          "en": "if they would behave like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.25,
          "end": 121.893,
          "en": "but thankfully in React, they don't.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}